# EUDI Trust & Conformance Atlas

> The EUDI Wallet reference: law, implementing acts, ARF requirements, standards, protocols and conformance evidence. Every document carries its adoption status and is cross-linked to related documents, glossary topics, reading routes and FCAF test cases.

## Core pages

- [Home]({{ site.url }}{{ '/' | url }}): the rulebook mapped — radar, roles, reading routes.
- [Regulatory radar]({{ site.url }}{{ '/radar/' | url }}): what changed, what is coming, version pins, timeline.
- [Reference]({{ site.url }}{{ '/reference/' | url }}): searchable catalogue of all {{ documents.totalCount }} documents, filterable by stack, status, type and ARF-essential.
- [Glossary]({{ site.url }}{{ '/glossary/' | url }}): the rulebook by topic — terms with document counts per stack layer.
- [Map]({{ site.url }}{{ '/map/' | url }}): the EUDI stack by task, with role highlighting.
- [FCAF framework]({{ site.url }}{{ '/fcaf/' | url }}): the EUDI Wallet functional conformance test cases for wallet-solution roles, grouped by section.
- [Data & Downloads]({{ site.url }}{{ '/data/' | url }}): machine-readable YAML/JSON source data.

## Raw data

- [EUDI documents map (YAML)]({{ site.url }}{{ '/data/eudi-documents-map.yaml' | url }}): the canonical documents data with status, dates, pinned versions and a changelog.
- [FCAF test catalogue (YAML)]({{ site.url }}{{ '/data/fcaf.yaml' | url }}): {{ fcaf.totalCount }} wallet-solution FCAF test cases with role, section, upstream file and normative references.
- [Source of truth]({{ site.url }}{{ '/data/source-of-truth/current.json' | url }}): the manifest-driven evidence source data.
- [Sitemap]({{ site.url }}{{ '/sitemap.xml' | url }}): every page.
